{
  "slug": "mygigsters-super",
  "name": "Mygigsters Super",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connects Claude to the MyGigsters superannuation API. Manage employees, submit super contributions, onboard employers, track payments, and verify super funds — all from within Claude, across QA and production environments.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `auth-setup` (Use this skill when the user asks to \"set up authentication\", \"create an API key\", \"login to MyGigsters\",…), `employee-management` (Use this skill when the user asks to \"add an employee\", \"create an employee record\", \"find an employee\",…), `employer-onboarding` (Use this skill when the user asks to \"onboard an employer\", \"register a new employer\", \"add a company…), `fund-verification` (Use this skill when the user asks to \"verify a super fund\", \"validate a USI\", \"validate an APRA…), `payment-tracking` (Use this skill when the user asks about \"payment status\", \"track a payment\", \"did the contribution go through\",…), `super-contributions` (Use this skill when the user asks to \"submit a superannuation contribution\", \"submit super\", \"validate a fund USI\",…)\n- **MCP servers** (2): `mygigsters-qa`, `mygigsters-prod`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mygigsters-super@claude-community` from `mygigsters/mygigsters-super-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
